0..51 Comment "//! This source states group laws as rewrite rules."
52..93 Comment "//! The circle loop obeys the group laws."
94..97 Comment "//!"
98..144 Comment "//! The written rules can form critical pairs."
145..194 Comment "//! Completion derives rules that join each pair."
